abstract: >
  This repository provides a reproducible analysis pipeline for studying 
  temporal patterns in AI-related job postings across Construction, Digital, 
  and Traditional sectors. It employs advanced time-series techniques including 
  STL decomposition, exponential smoothing forecasting, ARIMA modeling, and 
  moving-block bootstrap inference. The repository is designed for researchers 
  studying labor market dynamics, digital transformation in construction, and 
  AI adoption patterns.
